<title>HUNGARY: PANNONPLAST 1996 NET INCOME 1.42 BLN.</title>
<headline>PANNONPLAST 1996 NET INCOME 1.42 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary annual results for</p>
<p>1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					  Jan-Dec 1996	Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>Group earnings before </p>
<p>     interest and taxes	    1,108.4     vs     896.4</p>
<p>    Income before income tax     1,701.9     vs   1,058.2</p>
<p>    Net income for the year	1,420.2     vs     838.3</p>
<p>    Sales				9,673.9     vs   8,275.4</p>
<p>    Cost of sales		     6,263.3    vs    5,592.9</p>
<p>    Gross profit			3,410.6    vs    2,682.6</p>
<p>Administrative and general</p>
<p>	expenses			  2,096.0    vs    1,677.0</p>
<p>    Other expenses			301.9    vs	296.4</p>
<p>    Other income			   95.7    vs	187.2</p>
<p>    Net financial income		330.2    vs	105.8</p>
<p>	Financial revenue		 701.9    vs	337.3</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure	   371.7    vs	231.5</p>
<p>    Non-operating items		 263.3    vs	 56.1</p>
<p>    Extraordinary income		208.1    vs	183.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Pannonplast is a plastics industrial company.</p>
<p>The figures are consolidated and are calculated according</p>
<p>to International Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
